Init
Purpose: Rajesh confirms his eligibility and proceeds to submit personal details, billing and shipping addresses, nominee information, and delivery preferences. The init API finalizes the order intent and allows the BPP to perform any last validations before the quote is locked and confirmed.
Request Payload:


{
    "context": {
        "domain": "financial-services:uki",
        "action": "init",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "transaction_id": "f75f8973-3261-4931-902f-6a44a7a1ea75",
        "message_id": "4d5e6f7g-8h9i-0j1k-2l3m-4n5o6p7q8r9",
        "timestamp": "2025-06-02T09:06:00Z",
        "ttl": "PT10M",
        "bap_id": "bap-client.uki.network",
        "bap_uri": "https://bap-client.uki.network/protocol",
        "bpp_id": "insurance-bazaar.uki.network",
